<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 444)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Frame grabs are sized for sharing</b>: high-quality JPEG by default — a 4K grab lands around a megabyte instead of six. Tick <b>Lossless PNG</b> in the export dialog (or save with a .png extension) when lossless matters.</li>
<li>Manual: <b>"One room, every kind of seat"</b> — the recipe for mixing internal seats, remote Asobi Review seats, and browser seats in one session with one link.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
