<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 443)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Session ▸ Shared Review… works in an empty window.</b> It was disabled until media loaded — but joining an ad-hoc session is exactly what you do <i>before</i> any media is open: paste the session key, and the room supplies the clips. Invite a Reviewer… ungated likewise.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
